st', 'Fortified Village', 'Four Knocks', 'Fractured Identity', 'Frontier Bivouac', 'Frost Fair Lure Fish', 'Frostboil Snarl', 'Fugitive of the Judoon', 'Furycalm Snarl', 'Gallifrey Council Chamber', 'Gallifrey Falls // No More', 'Gallifrey Stands', 'Game Trail', 'Gardens of Tranquil Repose', 'Genesis of the Daleks', 'Glacial Fortress', "Graham O'Brien", 'Grasp of Fate', "Great Intelligence's Plan", 'Growth Spiral', 'Haunted Ridge', 'Heaven Sent', "Hero's Blade", "Heroes' Podium", 'Heroic Intervention', 'Horizon Canopy', 'Hotel of Fears', 'Human-Time Lord Meta-Crisis', 'Hunted by The Family', 'Ian Chesterton', 'Idris, Soul of the TARDIS', 'Impending Flux', 'Inspiring Refrain', 'Into the Time Vortex', 'Iraxxa, Empress of Mars', 'Irrigated Farmland', 'Island', 'Jamie McCrimmon', 'Jenny Flint', 'Jenny, Generated Anomaly', 'Jo Grant', 'Judoon Enforcers', 'K-9, Mark I', 'Karvanista, Loyal Lupari // Lupari Shield', 'Kate Stewart', 'Kerblam! Warehouse', 'Lake Silencio', 'Laser Screwdriver', 'Last Night Together', 'Lavaclaw Reaches', 'Leela, Sevateem Warrior', 'Lightning Greaves', 'Lunar Hatchling', 'Madame Vastra', 'Martha Jones', 'Me, the Immortal', 'Memory Worm', 'Midnight Crusader Shuttle', 'Mind Stone', 'Missy', 'Mondassian Colony Ship', 'Mountain', 'Myriad Landscape', 'Mystic Monastery', 'Nanogene Conversion', 'Nardole, Resourceful Cyborg', 'New New York', 'North Pole Research Base', 'Nyssa of Traken', 'Ominous Cemetery', 'Ood Sphere', 'Osgood, Operation Double', 'Out of Time', 'Overgrown Farmland', 'Path of Ancestry', 'Path to Exile', 'Peri Brown', 'Plains', 'Pompeii', 'Ponder', 'Port Town', 'Prairie Stream', 'Preordain', "Prime Minister's Cabinet Room", 'Propaganda', 'Psychic Paper', 'Quantum Misalignment', 'RMS Titanic', 'Rassilon, the War President', 'Regenerations Restored', 'Reliquary Tower', 'Renegade Silent', 'Return the Past', 'Return to Dust', 'Reverse the Polarity', 'River Song', "River Song's Diary", 'River of Tears', 'Rockfall Vale', "Rogue's Passage", 'Ro